Package: bitsandbytes-termux
Version: 1.1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: termux-learn-crypto <vilasrmeshram400@gmail.com>
Depends: glibc-repo, glibc-runner, python-glibc, python-pip-glibc
Section: python
Priority: optional
Description: bitsandbytes for Termux - k-bit model quantization (CPU)
 Termux (bionic) has no bitsandbytes wheels (last pure-Python release
 0.42, no CPU support). The PyPI aarch64 manylinux wheels need glibc
 and the 0.46+ CPU kernels run on aarch64 CPU. This installs the
 glibc toolchain, a glibc Python 3.12, torch (CPU) and bitsandbytes
 into it; your python3 (bionic) is untouched. Commands: bnb-python,
 bnb-check, bnb-setup. Set BNB_SKIP_SETUP=1 during apt install to skip
 the setup (run bnb-setup later); BNB_VERSION=0.50.2 pins bitsandbytes.
